Реальная отправка через REST API Contact Form 7
-----------------------------------------------
Inbound Messages до отправки:
$ wp post list --post_type=flamingo_inbound --format=count
0

Форма test-drive:
$ curl -sS -X POST 'http://127.0.0.1:8100/index.php?rest_route=/contact-form-7/v1/contact-forms/7/feedback' \
    -F '_wpcf7=7' -F '_wpcf7_version=6.1.7' -F '_wpcf7_locale=ru_RU' \
    -F '_wpcf7_unit_tag=wpcf7-f7-p1-o1' -F '_wpcf7_container_post=0' \
    -F 'your-name=EBIKE-21 E2E test-drive 20261110' \
    -F 'your-phone=+7 999 000-00-00' \
    -F 'your-email=lead-e2e-test-drive@example.test' \
